### ============================================
### HOSPITAL A — http://127.0.0.1:8000
### ============================================

### Register Hospital A
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/organisations/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hospitalA",
  "password": "newpass456",
  "email": "hospitalA@example.com",
  "name": "Hospital A",
  "organisation_type": "hospital",
  "location": "Korle Bu"
}

###

### Login Hospital A
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hospitalA",
  "password": "newpass456"
}

###

@tokenA = PASTE_TOKEN_A_HERE

### Add a patient under Hospital A
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/patients/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2NzUyOTQ1LCJpYXQiOjE3ODY3NDkzNDUsImp0aSI6IjMyYmNjMjliZWRiOTRkMGU5ODE2NTRkMmViNTE1MDIxIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjExIn0.gcI7IXlw18LUshNJQhuXnfG3YcTT5WY1-Cvp0zWBF9Q

{
  "patient_id": "P001",
  "name": "Kwame Asante",
  "age": 45,
  "gender": "M",
  "phone_number": "0244123456",
  "diagnosis": "Hypertension",
  "medication": "Lisinopril"
}

### List Hospital A's patients
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/patients/
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2NzUyOTQ1LCJpYXQiOjE3ODY3NDkzNDUsImp0aSI6IjMyYmNjMjliZWRiOTRkMGU5ODE2NTRkMmViNTE1MDIxIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjExIn0.gcI7IXlw18LUshNJQhuXnfG3YcTT5WY1-Cvp0zWBF9Q
### Check Hospital A's own public key
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/organisations/public-key/

### Hospital A views its own patients with masking applied
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/privacy/masking/view/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Hospital A applies masking and logs it for comparison
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/privacy/masking/apply/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Hospital A views its own comparison dashboard
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/privacy/comparison/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}


