POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/organisations/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hospitalB",
  "password": "testpass123",
  "email": "hospitalB@example.com",
  "name": "Hospital B",
  "organisation_type": "hospital",
  "location": "Komfo Anokye"
}

###

