### ============================================
### CROSS-SERVER: HYBRID ENCRYPTION (A -> B)
### ============================================

### Hospital A sends encrypted patient record to Hospital B
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/privacy/encryption/send/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

{
  "patient_id": "P001",
  "receiver_url": "http://127.0.0.1:8001"
}

### Hospital B views received encrypted records
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/privacy/encryption/received/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### Hospital B decrypts a received record (replace <id>)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/privacy/encryption/1/decrypt/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### Confirm the decrypted patient now exists in Hospital B's own patient list
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/patients/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}


### ============================================
### CROSS-SERVER: ANONYMIZATION (A -> B)
### ============================================

### Hospital A exports anonymized dataset to Hospital B
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/privacy/anonymization/export/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

{
  "receiver_url": "http://127.0.0.1:8001",
  "diagnosis_filter": "Hypertension"
}

### Hospital B views received anonymized datasets
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/privacy/anonymization/received/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}


### ============================================
### CROSS-SERVER: DIFFERENTIAL PRIVACY (B queries A)
### ============================================

### Hospital B queries Hospital A's noisy count of Hypertension patients
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/privacy/differential-privacy/query/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

{
  "target_url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
  "query_type": "count_by_diagnosis",
  "diagnosis": "Hypertension"
}

### Hospital B queries Hospital A's noisy average patient age
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/privacy/differential-privacy/query/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

{
  "target_url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
  "query_type": "average_age"
}


### ============================================
### ACCOUNT: PROFILE + PASSWORD RESET (per hospital's own server)
### ============================================

### Get currently logged-in organisation's details (Hospital A example)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/organisations/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Request password reset (Hospital A's server)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/organisations/password-reset/request/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hospitalA@example.com"
}

### Confirm password reset (replace uid/token from the email link)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/organisations/password-reset/confirm/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "PASTE_UID_HERE",
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE",
  "new_password": "newpass456"
}


